# scripts/opcount: `fsbench bench N` appends N files, ten to a directory,
# under tree/, walks the tree with fs.Walk and removes it with fs.RemoveAll
# (CAP-FS2); the cost of one file is the slope between the two sizes. The
# control is hand Go: the same files through the same host calls, then
# filepath.WalkDir and os.RemoveAll.
unit file
sizes 200 2000
args bench {n}
control benchmarks/fstree/testdata/control
